Subject: [PATCH 1327/3799] soh: rename func_80984048 -> DemoIk_Type2CheckCue

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the type 2 twin of DemoIk_Type1CheckCue, reading cue 4 and dispatching cues 1, 5 and 6 or killing the actor on cue 7; its osSyncPrintf names it "Demo_Ik_inFace_Check_DemoMode".
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ik/z_demo_ik.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
